      "knowledgePoint": "指定端口",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "OpenSSH 的 scp 怎样指定远程 SSH 端口，例如 2222？",
      "answer": "使用大写 -P，例如 scp -P 2222 本地文件 user@host:/目标路径。",
      "explanation": "小写 -p 用于保留文件属性。",
      "example": "scp -P 2222 ./data user@server:/tmp/。",
      "tags": [
        "OpenSSH",
        "指定端口"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
